    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an enthralling <strong>adventure</strong> as James, an ordinary man whose life takes an extraordinary turn. After a whirlwind digital romance with Maria, she mysteriously vanishes from his life as quickly as she appeared. All that remains is a single photograph, a beautiful image hinting at a secluded Russian village. Driven by an unshakeable connection and a desperate need for answers, James embarks on an epic journey to Donki Hills, a remote community near Novosibirsk, to uncover the truth behind Maria's disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1-Hour Narrative Experience:</strong> Immerse yourself in a focused and impactful story, designed to be completed in a single, engaging session.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Woodland Setting:</strong> Explore the serene yet mysterious woods of Donki Hills, brought to life with detailed environments and a captivating ambiance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Walking Simulator Gameplay:</strong> Progress through the narrative by exploring the environment, uncovering clues, and experiencing the unfolding story at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enigmatic Storytelling:</strong> Piece together the mystery of Maria's disappearance through environmental storytelling, subtle clues, and fragmented narratives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack:</strong> A hauntingly beautiful musical score accompanies your journey, enhancing the emotional depth and atmospheric tension of the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a concise yet profound journey into the heart of a mystery.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an enthralling <strong>adventure</strong> as James, an ordinary man whose life takes an extraordinary turn. After a whirlwind digital romance with Maria, she mysteriously vanishes from his life as quickly as she appeared. All that remains is a single photograph, a beautiful image hinting at a secluded Russian village. Driven by an unshakeable connection and a desperate need for answers, James embarks on an epic journey to Donki Hills, a remote community near Novosibirsk, to uncover the truth behind Maria's disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1-Hour Narrative Experience:</strong> Immerse yourself in a focused and impactful story, designed to be completed in a single, engaging session.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Woodland Setting:</strong> Explore the serene yet mysterious woods of Donki Hills, brought to life with detailed environments and a captivating ambiance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Walking Simulator Gameplay:</strong> Progress through the narrative by exploring the environment, uncovering clues, and experiencing the unfolding story at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enigmatic Storytelling:</strong> Piece together the mystery of Maria's disappearance through environmental storytelling, subtle clues, and fragmented narratives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack:</strong> A hauntingly beautiful musical score accompanies your journey, enhancing the emotional depth and atmospheric tension of the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a concise yet profound journey into the heart of a mystery.</p>",
